	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\n“Weird Al” Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour
	 LIVE at Ruoff Music Center\nThe undisputed king of comedy music\, “Weird 
	Al” Yankovic\, is bringing his brand-new  to Ruoff Music Center in Noblesv
	ille\, Indiana! Known for his hilarious parodies and original comedy songs
	\, Weird Al delivers a spectacular live show packed with costumes\, props\
	, and non-stop laughs. Don’t miss this legendary performer live on stage! 
	\nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: R
	uoff Music Center\nAddress: 12880 E. 146th St.\, Noblesville\, IN 46060\nP
	arking: Parking available on-site (sold separately)\nAge Requirement: All 
	ages welcome \nAbout “Weird Al” Yankovic\n \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious p
	arodies of today’s biggest pop hits\nElaborate costume changes and theatri
	cal performances\nClassic fan-favorite songs spanning four decades\nOrigin
	al comedy songs and polka medleys\nA high-energy\, family-friendly comedy 
	concert experience\n\n\nVenue Information\nRuoff Music Center is one of In
	diana’s premier outdoor amphitheaters\, located at 12880 E. 146th St. in N
	oblesville\, IN. The venue features both covered pavilion seating and open
	 lawn areas\, offering a fantastic concert experience for all attendees. \
	nTicket Information\nTickets start at $42. Secure your seats now before th
	ey sell out! Both official Ticketmaster tickets and resale options are ava
	ilable. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affilia
	te links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links a
	t no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to chang
	e. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com
	/event/weird-al-yankovic-bigger-weirder-tour-live-at-ruoff-music-center/\n
	\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/weird-al-yankovic-bigger-weirder-tour-
	live-at-ruoff-music-center/
