DESCRIPTION:Dinner Solved. Mission Served!\nPick up frozen Brookwood casser
	oles in your neighborhood.\n\nPURCHASE YOURS TODAY for Brookwood Casserole
	 Delivery Days – Memorial West Pickup!\nPre-order now and pick up Friday\,
	 August 7 | 5:00–6:30pm📍 Memorial Drive United Methodist Church – 12955 Me
	morial Dr\, Houston\, TX 77079 \n\nOur Citizens at The Brookwood Community
	™ know August can feel like a marathon of carpools\, college move-ins\, an
	d teacher meet-and-greets. That’s why we’re making life easier—and more de
	licious—with Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n✅ Three delicious frozen
	 casseroles to choose from✅ Pre-order online\, then swing by and pick up o
	n your way home✅ Serve 2–4 people – perfect for busy weeknights✅ Support a
	dults with disabilities who live and work with purpose at Brookwood \n\n🍴 
	Your Casserole Lineup:\n🥘 Beef & Spinach LasagnaSeasoned beef\, ricotta\, 
	mushrooms\, basil\, and penne pasta layered into savory perfection. \n🌮 Fi
	esta Chicken EnchiladaRoasted chicken\, sweet corn\, black beans\, queso f
	resco\, Latin-style red sauce\, and cheese between layers of corn tortilla
	s. \n🐔 King Ranch Chicken – we brought back a Brookwood FAVORITE!Texas com
	fort classic made with tender chicken\, tomatoes\, green chiles\, layered 
	tortillas\, and creamy cheesy goodness in every bite. \n\n💵 $35 each | Bul
	k Order Discounts:\n\nBuy 5+ and save 5% with code: 5CASS\nBuy 10+ and sav
	e 10% with code: 10CASS\n\n\nDinner made easy. Purpose made powerful.Thank
	 you for helping change the way the world thinks about adults with disabil
	ities. \n🗓️ Want to know where we’ll be next?Visit our Events Calendar for 
	the full schedule of Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n \n\nhttps://bro
	okwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-memorial-west-a
	rea-aug-7/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Market
