SUMMARY:Monthly Tandem Bike Riding with Achilles International - August 202
	6
DTSTAMP:20260804T053530Z
DTSTART:20260822T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Ride in Tandem – Inclusive Cycling with The Lighthouse and Achi
	lles International\nDon’t miss the thrill of our upcoming tandem bike ride
	 days! In partnership with Achilles International\, we’re bringing togethe
	r riders of all abilities for a fully inclusive tandem cycling workout\, f
	ollowed by a relaxed breakfast social to refuel and connect. \nWhere: Stud
	e Park – 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX 77007 \nWhen: Usually every Satu
	rday of the month\, 8:00–10:00 AM. Check our events calendar for exact dat
	es. \nPLEASE NOTE: If you are already an Achilles member\, please register
	 by Friday at 8:00 AM. If you are not yet an Achilles member\, please comp
	lete their free membership form here: https://achillesinternational.roster
	fy.com/register \nFor questions regarding tandem rides\, please contact Mi
	chaela with Achilles Houston at 346-819-7465. \nWant to make an even bigge
	r impact? Volunteers are needed to help guide riders\, assist with equipme
	nt\, and keep the event running smoothly. Whether you’re an experienced cy
	clist or just eager to lend a hand\, your support helps ensure a safe\, fu
	n\, and welcoming experience for all participants. \nFor more details or t
	o volunteer\, call 713-284-8424\, email youthadultservices@houstonlighthou
	se.org\, or visit the Achilles International Houston website. \nREGISTER H
	ERE. \n \n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding
	-with-achilles-international-august-2026/2026-08-22/\n\nFrom Houston Light
	house
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-with-ach
	illes-international-august-2026/2026-08-22/
LOCATION:Stude Park\, 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77007
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://houstonarboretum.or
 g/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Phenology-1280-x-720.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://houstonarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/05/Phenology-1280-x-720.png
UID:k4UPSQ6o8Y7sYC_YDxK3x
SUMMARY:Fourth Saturday Phenology Walk
DTSTAMP:20260804T053530Z
DTSTART:20260822T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Fourth Saturday of the Month9:00 – 11:00 amFree\, donations app
	reciatedAll ages\, minors must be accompanied by an adult \n\n\n\nMeet in 
	front of the Nature Center building \n\n\n\nDiscover the hidden seasonal r
	hythms of nature firsthand on our guided Phenology Walks\, where we track 
	the life cycles of different plants across ecosystems\, from the first spr
	ing bud burst to winter dormancy. You’ll learn how shifting weather patter
	ns and climate change influence the timing of these important events in ou
	r local ecosystems and how you can become a community scientist\, contribu
	ting vital data from your own backyard to a global research initiative.  \
	n\n\n\nThese relaxing morning walks are led by scientists from Rice Univer
	sity and staff from the Arboretum. We welcome nature enthusiasts of all ag
	es\, however kids 12 years and younger must be accompanied by a guardian. 
	\n\n\n\nLearn more about the study of phenology and ways you can contribut
	e at https://www.usanpn.org/nn \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCommunity Science Partner\n
	\nhttps://houstonarboretum.org/event/fourth-saturday-phenology-walk/2026-0
	8-22/\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/fourth-saturday-phenology-walk/2026-
	08-22/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-arboretum
CATEGORIES:Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
UID:kjlLlzAtzN8-idvpYAbj4
SUMMARY:Pokemon Mini Con
DTSTAMP:20260804T053530Z
DTSTART:20260822T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon Mini Con – Pick Your Starter\, Start Your Adventure\nAs
	k ten Pokémon fans how they got started and you’ll hear ten different answ
	ers. It might have been opening a Game Boy for the first time. Or racing h
	ome to watch the anime after school. Maybe it was pulling a favorite card 
	from a pack and carrying it everywhere for months. Pokémon Mini Con is all
	 about those moments! \n  \n📅 August 22\, 2026 | 10AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bisson
	net St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 E
	vent Highlights 🔥\n🛍️ Pokémon Marketplace\nThe marketplace floor at Pokémon
	 Mini Con feels a lot like stepping into the tall grass on Route 1. Every 
	booth brings a new encounter\, with cards to chase\, collectibles to disco
	ver\, and hidden gems waiting to be found. You never know when you’ll run 
	into the piece that completes your collection or the find you didn’t know 
	you needed. \n  \n🦹‍♂️ Pokémon Cosplay Showcase\nSuit up\, Trainers! Transfor
	m into your favorite Pokémon characters or Gym Leaders and show off your m
	oves in our cosplay showcase. \n  \n⚡ Be a Vendor\nNew encounter unlocked:
	 Pokémon Mini Con vendor applications are open! If you specialize in cards
	\, collectibles\, artwork\, or all things Pokémon\, we want you to be part
	 of the adventure. → https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🌊
	 Calling all Pokémon Fans\nEvery great Trainer needs the right team. We’re
	 looking for collaborators ready to join the journey to the Elite Four. \n
	🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8 \n🎤 Workshops & Pan
	els → https://forms.gle/cdpspG6VpUtpaNZ7A \n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://
	forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6 \nHave a love for Pokémon and want to be part 
	of the adventure? Bring your passion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 
	📩 \n  \nFrom your first starter Pokémon to your latest collection addition
	\, Pokémon Mini Con celebrates every step of the Trainer journey. 🧢\n\nhtt
	ps://ccs-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT7H
END:VEVENT
