	e ION bringing together Lumino’s partners\, merchants\, and builders to ta
	lk relationships\, opportunities\, and implementation. This session is abo
	ut turning the momentum from the launch into concrete next steps: partners
	hip conversations\, onboarding support\, and a shared roadmap for building
	 the future of local commerce together.\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/p
	artner-builder-breakfast/\n\nFrom Ion District
