	 Virginia\, Utah and Connecticut have state laws that prevent resale restr
	ictions. In those states\, Ticketmaster will still honor Freya Skye's term
	s by keeping resale prices at face value on its site. To reduce staff cont
	act with guest belongings\, we have implemented the following bag policy: 
